Z||000005||ray b||08-22-2001||01:48 PM||||vett wheel cyl leak cure is to line the bores in the alum calipers with stainless steel incerts 4 per wheel, unsure if pistons are replaced too or canbe reused. ask on a vett board itis a common fix. porsche brakes are fine but the fine is steap for them  SS reline at 250 a wheel is way cheaper.<P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||1
